    "title": "Savy Translate:Voice&Photo",
    "description": "Savy Translate is committed to providing more convenient translation services, integrating image translation, text translation, voice translation, favorites and other functions to meet users' diverse translation needs.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n-Supports multi-language translation, including English, French, Russian and other languages, with accurate and reliable translation.\r\n\ufeff\r\n-You can use the camera to take pictures, or translate by identifying album pictures, so that you can get information more quickly.\r\n\r\n-Through the audio translation function, it helps users travel abroad and reduce language communication barriers.\r\n\ufeff\r\n-For users who learn foreign languages, the text translation function reduces the time of flipping through dictionaries and improves learning efficiency.\r\n\ufeff\r\n-Important content can be added to favorites with one click, which is convenient for users to check and manage.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Savy Translate is committed to providing more convenient translation services, integrating image translation, text translation, voice translation, favorites and other functions to meet users&#39; diverse translation needs.<br><br>Features:<br>-Supports multi-language translation, including English, French, Russian and other languages, with accurate and reliable translation.<br>\ufeff<br>-You can use the camera to take pictures, or translate by identifying album pictures, so that you can get information more quickly.<br><br>-Through the audio translation function, it helps users travel abroad and reduce language communication barriers.<br>\ufeff<br>-For users who learn foreign languages, the text translation function reduces the time of flipping through dictionaries and improves learning efficiency.<br>\ufeff<br>-Important content can be added to favorites with one click, which is convenient for users to check and manage.",
